<title>BOLIVIA: SOCCER-PARAGUAY BEAT CHILE 1-0 IN COPA AMERICA.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-PARAGUAY BEAT CHILE 1-0 IN COPA AMERICA.</headline>
<dateline>COCHABAMBA, Bolivia 1997-06-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Paraguay beat</p>
<p>Chile 1-0 (halftime 1-0) in a Copa America first round group A</p>
<p>match on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Scorer: Roberto Acuna (28th minute)</p>
<p>Attendance: 18,000</p>
</text>
